Audio
=====

All gameplay audio shipped with this pass is original procedural synthesis
written for Aruba World. No third-party recordings, samples, or sound fonts
are used.

  Player car engine        original harmonic cycle + exhaust layer     CC0 1.0
  Player sportbike engine  original V4-style cycle + exhaust layer     CC0 1.0
  Crash impact             original synthesised thump and crunch       CC0 1.0
  Police wail              original two-sine sweep                     CC0 1.0
  Ambulance hi-lo          original two-sine crossfade                 CC0 1.0
  Turbo roar and whoosh    original noise, sub oscillators, sweep      CC0 1.0
  Beach and city beds      original looped noise                       CC0 1.0

CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The same notice is added to the in-game Credits list.
